Design a circuit that computes the CRC-CCITT (Cyclic Redundancy Check) for a 16-bit input data stream. The module utilizes a shift register to process the incoming data and applies the CRC polynomial defined for CCITT, efficiently generating an 8-bit CRC output based on the shifted data. The result is produced at the output whenever the clock signal indicates a new data input.
