description:
Design a simple 8-bit up counter that increments on each positive edge of the clock signal. When the counter reaches its maximum value of 255 (0xFF), it resets to 0 and activates a rollover signal to indicate that a full count has been completed. During regular operation, the rollover signal remains low.
module top_module(
   input clk,
   output reg [7:0] count,
   output reg rollover
   );

code:
module top_module(
   input clk,
   output reg [7:0] count,
   output reg rollover
   );always @(posedge clk) begin
      if (count == 8'hFF) begin
         count <= 0;
         rollover <= 1;
      end else begin
         count <= count + 1;
         rollover <= 0;
      end
   end

endmodule

