description:
Design a 4-bit asynchronous counter with enable functionality. When the reset signal (RST) is low, the counter resets to zero regardless of the clock (CLK) status. If the reset is high and the enable signal (EN) is active, the counter increments its value by one on every positive edge of the clock signal.
