description:
Design a 4-bit barrel shifter that rotates the input data, DIN, based on the 2-bit SHIFT control signal. When SHIFT is '00', the output DOUT retains the original value of DIN. With SHIFT '01', it performs a right rotation by one position; with '10', it performs a right rotation by two positions; and with '11', it rotates the bits to the right by three positions. This module effectively supports data manipulation through efficient rotation of bits for various applications in digital systems.
module top_module(
    input [3:0] DIN,
    input [1:0] SHIFT,
    output reg [3:0] DOUT
);

code:
module top_module(
    input [3:0] DIN,
    input [1:0] SHIFT,
    output reg [3:0] DOUT
);always @(*) begin
    case (SHIFT)
        2'b00: DOUT = DIN;
        2'b01: DOUT = {DIN[2:0], DIN[3]};
        2'b10: DOUT = {DIN[1:0], DIN[3:2]};
        2'b11: DOUT = {DIN[0], DIN[3:1]};
    endcase
end

endmodule

