description:
Design a bidirectional buffer with control. The module has an input A and an output Q, with a control signal EO that determines the buffer's direction. When EO is high, A is passed to the bidirectional line BI, effectively driving it with the value of A. When EO is low, BI is set to high impedance, allowing it to float and making Q read the state of BI. This functionality enables the module to either transmit data from input A to output Q or to disconnect from the bus, controlling data flow in a digital circuit.
module top_module(
A, EO, Q, BI
);

