description:
Design a clock signal generator that introduces a programmable delay. The module takes a clock input and generates a delayed version of that clock output, where the delay is defined by a parameter. The delayed clock output goes high for one clock cycle after a specified number of input clock cycles, effectively creating a delayed pulse.
