description:
Design a virtual master device for an I2C (Inter-Integrated Circuit) communication protocol. This module generates the SDA (Serial Data) and SCL (Serial Clock) signals necessary for data transmission. The `sendData` task is responsible for sending an 8-bit address followed by an 8-bit data payload, toggling the SCL signal to indicate clock cycles while setting the SDA signal to transmit data. The module also implements a debugging signal that is initialized to zero. This design is intended for controlling and communicating with I2C slave devices in a microcontroller or FPGA system.
