description:
Design a clock generator that produces a toggling clock signal. Upon receiving a reset signal (high), the clock output is set low. When the reset is not active, the clock signal toggles every 5 time units on the falling edge of the clock, creating a periodic clock output suitable for use in synchronous digital circuits.
module top_module(
    input reset,
    output reg clock
);

code:
module top_module(
    input reset,
    output reg clock
);always @(posedge reset or negedge clock)
    if (reset)
        clock <= 0;
    else
        #5 clock <= ~clock;

endmodule

