Design a digital clock circuit that tracks the current hours and minutes based on a clock pulse input. The clock resets to 1:00 upon receiving a reset signal. It features two control signals—set_hours and set_minutes—which allow the user to increment the hour and minute values, respectively, cycling from 11 back to 1 for hours and from 59 back to 0 for minutes. The output consists of 4-bit representations of the current hour and minute values.
